{"sym":"CHAR.L","v":2,"about":{"summary":"Chariot Limited, together with its subsidiaries, engages in exploration, appraisal and development of upstream oil and gas assets. The company operates through Upstream Oil & Gas, Renewable Power, and Green Hydrogen segments. It holds interests in the Lixus and Rissana offshore; and Loukos onshore licenses in Morocco. The company also engages in the electricity trading; and green hydrogen businesses. In addition, it undertakes renewable generation projects comprising wind and solar projects. The company was formerly known as Chariot Oil & Gas Limited and changed its name to Chariot Limited in June 2021. Chariot Limited was incorporated in 2007 and is based in Saint Peter Port, Guernsey.","lead":"Chariot Limited, together with its subsidiaries, engages in exploration, appraisal and development of upstream oil and gas assets. The company operates through Upstream Oil & Gas, Renewable Power, and Green Hydrogen segments.","web":"https://chariotenergygroup.com","city":"Saint Peter Port","country":"Guernsey"},"officers":[{"n":"Mr. Adonis Pouroulis B.Sc., Eng.","t":"Co-Founder, CEO & Director","age":55,"yb":1970,"pay":326080,"fy":2025},{"n":"Mr. Julian Robert Cecil Maurice-Williams","t":"CFO & Executive Director","age":46,"yb":1979,"pay":272360,"fy":2025},{"n":"Mr. Duncan McIntosh Wallace","t":"Technical Director & Executive Director","age":46,"yb":1979,"pay":271600,"fy":2025},{"n":"Nick Shepherd","t":"General Counsel","fy":2025},{"n":"Mr. Pierre Raillard","t":"Head of Gas Business & Morocco Country Director","fy":2025},{"n":"Laurent Coche","t":"Chief Executive Officer of Green Hydrogen","fy":2025},{"n":"Mr. Paul Breaden","t":"Group Financial Controller","fy":2025},{"n":"Benoit Garrivier","t":"CEO of Transitional Power","fy":2025}],"own":{"ins":30.03,"inst":11.37,"inst_float":16.25,"inst_n":5},"funds":[{"n":"DFA INVESTMENT DIMENSIONS GROUP INC-World ex U.S. Core Eqy. PORT.","pct":0.02,"pos":478060,"val":15112,"chg":100.0,"d":"2026-